        "rephrase": {
          "p_cf1": "Built deterministic comparable-company matching over 221 profiles and 1,116 cover lines with a single LLM call, costing ~\u00a30.003 per query and completing in under 3 s.",
          "p_ia1": "Designed preprocessing and clustering pipelines (K-Means, HAC, DBSCAN) across BoW, TF-IDF, Skip-gram and SBERT, tracing silhouette <0.30 to repeated template vocabulary in tickets.",
          "p_gg2": "Trained per-gene regression models for 11,459 genes using OLS and GPU random forest, reducing RAM from 8.2 to 5.5 GB and revealing overfitting (train Pearson 0.807 vs test 0.545).",
          "p_gg1": "Merged 14 public omics source files into a graph of 1,399 cell lines and 16,385 genes (~2.8 M edges), then applied Leiden community detection to identify 19 clusters with modularity 0.822."
        },
